Evidence/reassessment/applicability.json and retained-inputs.json bind the earlier complete MCP suite, Core command-flow suite and other retained inputs. A 19,336-file comparison first found only the approved guard entry/test changes; final-source-scope.json additionally identifies the one-byte Core guidance correction and its canonical generated outputs. Unchanged full-suite subpaths, writer/recovery, task/parser/audit, SDK/locks and performance implementation retain their source-bound evidence. Affected contract/CLI/protocol/renderer/build/budget/performance checks were rerun above. Guard integration remains unchanged by the later description-only correction. This is reviewed applicability, not an automatic transfer of all old fulfillment.

